    add('Outcome-stratified description','Clusters were discovered using all qualified structure, not trophies. After fitting, soft factor prevalence, observed game WR and stronger-build inclusion uplift are reported. Stronger means>=5 observed games and observed WR>=.6; this is **not a trophy/final-event label**. Within-shell with/without-card observed WR is descriptive and selection-biased. Target final records are not imported into inference.\n\nOutcomes never enter factor identities, pair residuals or candidate A. The separately ignored uplift artifact and portable counts/examples preserve denominators. Modal build association is not proof of successful construction; actual completed event records are unavailable in the primary build summaries, so no invented mean final record is reported.')
